  "content": "\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#f0e\">Tensura Horizons Expanded</span><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"> — это дополнение к моду,</span> <span style=\"color:#3598db\">Tensura: Reincarnated.<br><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">Мод вводит <span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">Н</span><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">овые Пути Эволюции Рас </span>для определённых рас, <span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">Новые Расы</span> в целом, а также <span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">Н</span><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">овые Навыки.</span></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><span style=\"color:#b0b0b0\"><br><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">Расы<br><span style=\"color:#b0b0b0\"><span style=\"color:#fffd01\">Гигант </span><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">получил</span><span style=\"color:#843fa1\"><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"> </span><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">Два Дополнительных</span></span><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"> расы добавлены, а также внесены изменения в уже существующие расы гигантов.</span></span><br></span></span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><span style=\"color:#b0b0b0\"><span style=\"color:#fcff00\"><span style=\"color:#fffd01\">Большой Гигант</span> </span><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">-</span><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"> </span><span style=\"color:#24a259\">Гигант</span> </span><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">--&gt; </span><span style=\"color:#0eff00\">Большой Гигант </span><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">--&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"> </span><span style=\"color:#24a259\">Древний Гигант</span></span><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"> </span><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">--&gt; </span><span style=\"color:#0eff00\">Титан</span> <span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">--&gt; </span><span style=\"color:#24a259\">Божественный <span style=\"color:#0eff00\">Титан<br><br><span style=\"color:#fffd01\">Химеран<span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"> - <span style=\"color:#ba372a\">Кастомная Расa </span>всего 29 рас.&nbsp;</span></span><br></span></span></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><span style=\"color:#b0b0b0\"><span style=\"color:#24a259\"><span style=\"color:#0eff00\"><br><span style=\"color:#fff\">Навыки<br><span style=\"color:#f8cac6\"><span style=\"color:#dc746b\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><span style=\"color:#b0b0b0\"><span style=\"color:#24a259\"><span style=\"color:#0eff00\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#f8cac6\"><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><span style=\"color:#e8c000\">Уникальные:</span><br></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><span style=\"color:#b0b0b0\"><span style=\"color:#24a259\"><span style=\"color:#0eff00\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#f8cac6\"><span style=\"color:#dc746b\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><span style=\"color:#b0b0b0\"><span style=\"color:#24a259\"><span style=\"color:#0eff00\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#f8cac6\"><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><span style=\"color:#dc746b\">Наследник <span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">-</span> <span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">Шанс получить при реинкарнации</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><span style=\"color:#b0b0b0\"><span style=\"color:#24a259\"><span style=\"color:#0eff00\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#f8cac6\"><span style=\"color:#dc746b\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><span style=\"color:#b0b0b0\"><span style=\"color:#24a259\"><span style=\"color:#0eff00\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#f8cac6\"><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><br><br>Врожденные:</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br>Сейсмический топот </span><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">-<span style=\"color:#236fa1\"> <span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">Эволюция в</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#0eff00\"><span style=\"color:#fffd01\">Большого Гиганта.</span><br><span style=\"color:#dc746b\">Композитное тело </span><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">- Начинать как</span> <span style=\"color:#fffd01\">Химерана.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><span style=\"color:#b0b0b0\"><span style=\"color:#24a259\"><span style=\"color:#0eff00\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#f8cac6\"><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><span style=\"color:#0eff00\"><span style=\"color:#fffd01\"><br><span style=\"color:#fff\">Следующее обновление<br><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">Балансировка эволюций для <span style=\"color:#fffd01\">Химерана</span>.<br>Новая <span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">Раса</span>.<br><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">Новый <span style=\"color:#e8c000\">Уникальный</span> навык.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></p>",
